  "description": "Watch now | How many times have we heard this? Also, Gaps & Position Sizing",
  "body_html": "<p>Don’t get me wrong…I think a big market crash is in the works. But even through today….even the miserable chop we have been enduring…there is no clear signal that we are approaching an imminent bear market. Relax. </p><p>Trust me, when I see the signals, I will let you know. I am kind of excited for a genuine bear market, to wipe away all these late stage bull market gurus that popped up like weeds on social media. Plus, I look forward to taking a break haha. </p><h4>Even though today sucks, we are fine, for now.</h4><p>If you missed any of these posts this week, be sure to check them out when you have a moment:</p><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-best-foreign-etfs-right-now?r=4z8lgl\">The Best Foreign ETFs Right Now</a></strong></p><ul><li><p>Best for investors wanting to spread money out broadly and looking for a longer term approach (several months to year+.)</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-etf-keeps-pulling-away?r=4z8lgl\">Top Stock This Week</a></strong></p><ul><li><p>Best for mid term investors (several days to weeks). Also discusses the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a>, which is officially now double the performance of the S&amp;P 500 (image below). These stocks still have more upward trajectory in my opinion. Several of these stocks are keeping my personal portfolio in the green. </p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/v/G4JKzejz/\">Position Sizing Calculator</a></strong></p><ul><li><p>Discussed in the video and down below. </p></li></ul></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png\" width=\"884\" height=\"809\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:809,&quot;width&quot;:884,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:64927,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/207431657?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jmK2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc2b4e37-6c0f-4e45-b104-42572ecb45a3_884x809.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">StockTok ETF is now more than double, approaching triple, the performance of the S&amp;P 500. </figcaption></figure></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"> — Education: Gaps &amp; Position Sizing —</h3><h4>Gaps </h4><p>Watch the video, as I explain more, but gaps are when a stock opens significantly higher, or lower, than the prior period’s closing price. The longer the timeframe, or larger the market cap, the more reliable the gap is. </p><ul><li><p><strong>Continuation</strong>: When price action continues running up after a gap up, or vice verse if a gap down.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2N59!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ed3aecc-3e4e-401b-bad7-3a6f08268fbe_1353x859.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2N59!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ed3aecc-3e4e-401b-bad7-3a6f08268fbe_1353x859.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2N59!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s